---
title: Relic ratings use a single-piece quality baseline
---

Relic ratings now compare substat quality with one random five-star +15 relic conditioned on the same character, slot and main stat, replacing the previous best-of-three baseline. Scores change accordingly, while main/substat combination, set integrity and effective occurrence rules remain unchanged. This changes the meaning of the comparison baseline; it does not fix a percentile lookup error or estimate farming stamina costs.
